odel of the eye, anatomical model of the ear, cross-section of the tooth, cross-section of the skin.\n\nContact our customer support via email: info@medicinevirtual.com .", "short_description": "-- Quest version now available - search for Human Anatomy VR on AppLab. --\n\nHuman anatomy is essential part of medicine. This app represents a unique approach of learning general anatomy. Thanks to excellent graphics, informative content and innovative features is learning rich and engaging experience."}]}, "developer_name": "Virtual Medicine, ltd.", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.medicinevirtual.com/data/Licence_VM.pdf", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.medicinevirtual.com/data/Licence_VM.pdf", "publisher_name": "Virtual Medicine, ltd.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.medicinevirtual.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["EDUCATIONAL", "EXPLORATION", "MEDICINE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER", "TOUCHPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "5653238074727871"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984450_320431765459100_8348317972653146112_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ii44mcVSyLwQ7kNvwFtRU6F&_nc_oc=AdrPgGr3kpdjfSYFXWg-TPBmT6PzgVO_Bd4DDH2Hr6oynVXiyVwOdcXn_CC6vmMWXTE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3HOFoab-mmva-7K7Xd89DANkwHq3NW0ol--0izfVyw4A&oe=69EB8187"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": 